Built on [sekvent]({{sekvent_git_url}}).

## Layout

- `crates/` — the workspace members. Each crate's `src/main.rs` is thin;
  the logic and its tests live in the library.
- `proto/` — protobuf contracts, compiled in `build.rs` (gRPC services only).
- `sekvent.toml` — gate, coverage and task configuration.

## Development

Install the CLI once:

```sh
curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/westito/sekvent-api/master/scripts/install.sh | sh
```

Then:

```sh
cargo fmt --all              # formatting runs locally
cargo sekvent check          # compiling commands run on the remote builder
cargo sekvent test
cargo sekvent gate           # fmt --check, clippy, tests: must pass before merging
cargo sekvent coverage       # per-package line coverage floors
```

Configuration comes from the environment; see `.env.example` for the keys.
A missing or malformed key stops the service at startup with the key's name.

## Release image

```sh
docker build --build-arg BIN={{crate_name}} -t {{crate_name}} .
docker run --rm --env-file .env -e LISTEN_ADDR=0.0.0.0:8080 -p 8080:8080 {{crate_name}}
```

## Updating sekvent

```sh
cargo sekvent sdk update     # moves the locked sekvent revision and the pinned dependency set
```
